            },
            {
              "title": "obs_slot",
              "description": "Index of the slot that holds the time the value was OBSERVED, in POSIX milliseconds (for example the `updatedAt`\n that a price feed signs), or -1 when the feed carries none. The signature timestamp says when the Airnode signed;\n this says how old the value itself was.",
